  <metadata>
    <name>Day 3 - Refugio State Beach to Los Angeles Union Station</name>
    <desc>The Santa Barbara channel coast, the Rincon, Ventura and Oxnard, Point Mugu and the Malibu shoreline on PCH, Santa Monica, then east across Los Angeles to Union Station and the train home.</desc>
